You are a senior full-stack engineer, database architect, CMS engineer, and premium UI/UX designer.

Build a COMPLETE production-ready website and custom CMS for:

REKAR GROUP
Digital Agency & Technology

IMPORTANT:
This must NOT be a static agency website.

I need a FULL BACKEND + DATABASE + SECURE ADMIN DASHBOARD so that almost every visible part of the website can be managed without editing source code.

The final website must behave like a custom-built CMS.

==================================================
1. CORE GOAL
==================================================

Build a premium Kurdish technology/agency website for Rekar Group.

The public website must contain:

- Home
- Services
- Projects / Portfolio
- Project Details
- News / Insights / Blog
- Blog Details
- About
- Contact
- Custom dynamic pages

But all important website content must be editable from an Admin Dashboard.

I must be able to:

